  "bank": "Keep the exact original73 physical policies. Generate one shared expansion using the registered new seed and original routes, stable deduplication and ranking rules. Nominate with the old ranked_v1 uncalibrated base source/GP models, then evaluate every target arm with its currently frozen model/calibration. Record actual physical and representation overlap with the old bank, including duplicates within generated coordinates; neither promise31 independent policies nor redraw/rerank based on overlaps or target outcomes.",
  "representation": "Same mean4/risk10 public representation algorithms and eight source identities; the bank builder computes coordinates for the actual new policies without fitting to target data. All structural models use frozen source_risk_calibration_v1 during target execution. Geometry independence of the descriptors is inherited; old nominal coordinates are not pasted onto new physical policies.",
  "response_units": "Identity mapping for f,g-tau,log sigma_f^2,log sigma_g^2. Formula uses normalized control-group means and global SD, not a dimension sum. L,sigma,alpha,weights,tau are identical; changes caused by actual policy/group geometry are not response-unit rescaling.",
  "selection": "Preserve all seven query/terminal mechanisms and order3. Online round1 uses89 candidates with remaining360, and round2 all104 with remaining359. Frozen-query holds its complete initialized posterior fixed and only its point-only terminal reads its own search raw; dual updates both channels. Native model counters do not override actual call budgets.",
  "terminal": "Unchanged point-only terminal for frozen-query, complete-model terminal for original full arm and original definitions for the other five arms. Each task has two STOP arms with360 verifier episodes and five online arms with358 each. Every arm has total362 logical calls. Freeze all112 recommendations before any verifier; finish all112 independent verifiers before explicit truth scoring.",
  "mechanism_diagnostic": "Compare dual minus frozen-query for the value of adapting the complete query posterior to search observations under the same point-only terminal, and dual minus same-source GP online for method value on the new shared bank. The former includes own-point conditioning and cross-policy propagation. Keep full, no-cross, STOP and GP references and query/terminal prediction channels distinct; report bank overlap instead of assuming independent expansion policies.",
  "endpoints": "Use only this newly registered16-task cohort for main statistics. Report actual/conditional safe rewards, false certificates and paired dual-minus-frozen-query and dual-minus-GP-online differences, with all other arms retained. Record paths, observed status, original/generated recommendations and channel prediction diagnostics. No outcome-based stopping/replacement/extension; all112 recommendations frozen and all112 verifiers finished before truth scoring.",
  "randomness": "Candidate generation uses its uniquely registered seed2026101620 once, retaining original source-only routes and uncalibrated base nomination. Draw exactly16 geometries via task_configs(seed2026101621), excluding source00..07, nominal and48 old targets at1561/1571/1581/1591/1601/1611 by public kwargs only. Seeds2026101622/23/24/25 independently control initialization/search/verification/bootstrap. Share two fresh initialization raws within each task; five online arms separately execute and pay for two searches. Equal task/round/query keys pair equal raws without borrowing calls; verification is independent of search.",
  "accounting": "32 shared initialization +160 separately executed search +40160 independent verification =40352 new physical calls;112*362=40544 logical calls. Verification is16*(2*360+5*358). Each frozen-query raw updates only its terminal, but still costs one physical and one logical episode; its unchanged query posterior counter2 is not the arm resource counter. All new source/calibration/original-law/GP fits remain0. Preserve prior ledgers and record numerical work/failures separately.",
